### TEMPLATE ONLY - chua gui request. Thay placeholder bang du lieu H1 duoc phep.
### Token chi dung trong Burp/private, khong commit ban da dien token.

### Owner control A
GET {{base_url}}/api/orders/{{order_a}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token_a}}
Accept: application/json

### Cross-user: B doc don A
GET {{base_url}}/api/orders/{{order_a}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token_b}}
Accept: application/json

### Guest - khong Authorization/Cookie
GET {{base_url}}/api/orders/{{order_a}}
Accept: application/json

### User thuong goi API admin
GET {{base_url}}/api/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token_a}}
Accept: application/json

### Admin control
GET {{base_url}}/api/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token_admin}}
Accept: application/json
